---
description: Application and provider architecture boundaries
alwaysApply: true
---

Preserve domain authority inside PerchPoint. Put providers behind replaceable adapters.
Use idempotency and durable inbox/outbox patterns for future external effects. Phase 0 FastAPI,
Mongo intake, and role previews are synthetic scaffolding, not production architecture.
Requirements: `PP-PROV-002`, `PP-DATA-004`, `PP-NFR-002`.
